2026-08-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-1143) 'Two scorers catch a fit that looks right while the joints are wrong.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-1143) '`fourloops-plan.exs` carries four loops as prims, each with its stages, its artifact and one line of hazard. A prim holds the wiring and cannot hold the argument, so the reason a loop is shaped this way lived in a logbook entry that the plan named as a source.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-1143) 'Read RFD66606-1144, RFD66606-1145 and RFD66606-1146 for the other three loops.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-1143) 'Propose with Keypoints, AnnyFit and Render; score with EditScore and the Referee; repair by refitting. The artifact is a render png. It is the largest of the four at size L, and it runs fourth in the task order because the harness comes first.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-1143) 'Two scorers rather than one, because they answer different questions. EditScore reads the image and the Referee reads the body, and a fit that looks right while the joints are wrong passes the first alone.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1143) '**The hazard is the joint count.** The detector emits 17 keypoints and the render asset emits 23. A comparison across those two takes an explicit subset, or it compares different things and reports a number for it. RFD66606-1122 records the same gap for the wholebody chain.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1143) 'RFD66606-1144, RFD66606-1145 and RFD66606-1146 are the other three loops. RFD66606-1122 is the goal, and `logbook-fourloops-first-runs.md` holds the first runs.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1143) 'The problem
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1143) 'All four loops are wanted. What was missing is a document per loop: the plan holds the wiring for four, and one logbook entry held the argument for all of them. This RFD is loop 1's own.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD1143  1 LINE
 Text:Written
